{"alias":"/data-reporting/ReportingCalendars","title":"Student and Staff Data Reporting Calendars","changed":"2026-08-25T12:13:17+00:00","before":"<p><img alt=\"Data Calendar Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"42ca3f0a-d52b-443d-ae9b-3a3792e4a65c\" height=\"100%\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Data%20-%20Calendars%20Banner.png\" width=\"100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>Reporting Calendar</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"dc-note\">\r\n<p>Reports are usually opened on the 1st and due on the 15th. See below for specific due dates. Select your school type to view the applicable reporting calendar.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"lesson-tabs js-tabs\"><!-- Radios --><input checked=\"checked\" id=\"rc-public\" name=\"rcTabs\" type=\"radio\" /> <input id=\"rc-60funded\" name=\"rcTabs\" type=\"radio\" /> <input id=\"rc-nonsec\" name=\"rcTabs\" type=\"radio\" /> <input id=\"rc-special\" name=\"rcTabs\" type=\"radio\" /> <input id=\"rc-regional\" name=\"rcTabs\" type=\"radio\" /> <input id=\"rc-atr\" name=\"rcTabs\" type=\"radio\" /> <!-- Labels -->\r\n<div class=\"tab-labels\"><label class=\"tab-button\" for=\"rc-public\">Public SAU</label> <label class=\"tab-button\" for=\"rc-60funded\">Private 60% Funded</label> <label class=\"tab-button\" for=\"rc-nonsec\">Private Non-Sectarian</label> <label class=\"tab-button\" for=\"rc-special\">Private Special Purpose</label> <label class=\"tab-button\" for=\"rc-regional\">Regional Programs</label> <label class=\"tab-button\" for=\"rc-atr\">Applied Technology</label></div>\r\n<!-- Content panels -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"content\"><!-- PUBLIC SAU -->\r\n<div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"rc-public-content\">\r\n<h3>RSU / MSU / MSAD / CSD / Charter Schools / State Operated</h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"background-color:#182b3c; color:#fff; width:140px;\">Month</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scop